            {
              "id": "1768095928391_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Input : {{$context.$nodes.GET_ACTIVE_INCIDENT.$output}} \n\nAnalyze the current list of active Code Enforcement incidents {{$context.$nodes.GET_ACTIVE_INCIDENT.$output}}. Extract Following Information for chart display for each Incident\n\nIssuesubtype\nPriority\nstatus\naddress\n\nYour objectives are to: Analyze the current active Code Enforcement incidents and generate visual charts based on your findings. Please make sure you display all  charts \n\nSummary: Based on the analysis of active Code Enforcement incidents, several neighborhoods are showing elevated incident volumes, particularly with clusterings in certain “red zone” areas. Multiple escalated incidents have been reported in repeat locations, indicating urgent areas for intervention. \n\nChart 1: Incident Status Breakdown \nChart configuration: \nX-axis: Incident Status (Reported, Inspection, Undetermined, Violation)\n Y-axis: Number of Incidents\nChart type: Stacked bar chart\n Series: Escalated, Non-Escalated\n\nChart 2: Incident Issue Subtype Breakdown \nChart configuration: \nX-axis: IssueSubtype\n Y-axis: Number of Incidents\nChart type: Stacked bar chart\n Series: Escalated, Non-Escalated\n\n\nDo not Display any action buttons below the chart"
            }
          ],
